<Base title="About"><div class="wrap"><article class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">About the publication</div><h1>Curiosity, with clarity.</h1><p>IbrahimBlog is an independent technology publication by Shaik Ibrahim. It follows the ideas, products, security developments, and open-source projects shaping the digital world.</p><p>Our aim is simple: explain what happened, show where the information came from, and make room for what is still uncertain.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Research and drafts may be assisted by locally hosted AI tools. A human editor reviews stories before publication, checks sources and decides what to publish. AI assistance does not guarantee accuracy.</p><p>Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> with a correction or tip.</p></article></div></Base>
